### Bug Scenario and Root Cause

The bug scenario image shows a report with zero passing audits, yet it still displays a dropdown option to view passed items. This is misleading because there are no passed items to view. The root cause is that the code does not check if there are any passed audits before creating the dropdown element.

### Bug Location and Analysis

In the provided code snippet from `lighthouse-core/report/v2/renderer/report-renderer.js`, the issue is in the `_renderCategory` method. The code creates a `<details>` element for passed audits regardless of whether there are any passed audits. This element should only be created if there are passed audits to display.

### Patch

